I don't laugh so much.

00:44:24.790 --> 00:44:26.270
It's what you're not used to drinking.

00:44:26.490 --> 00:44:27.250
Drink a little more.

00:44:27.390 --> 00:44:29.530
Pablo, this is a shame.

00:44:30.000 --> 00:44:30.760
What's going on?

00:44:30.840 --> 00:44:32.340
Open that door and you'll see what's going on.

00:44:35.030 --> 00:44:37.720
Open it!

00:44:37.920 --> 00:44:41.680
It will come. Here are the keys.

00:44:42.450 --> 00:44:44.710
I don't know if I can. You know that my husband...

00:44:44.710 --> 00:44:45.750
But Celia...

00:44:48.780 --> 00:44:50.320
Why do you have to talk to that man?

00:44:50.420 --> 00:44:50.680
Ma'am!

00:44:50.860 --> 00:44:51.520
You shut up!

00:44:51.580 --> 00:44:52.400
I don't accept your orders.

00:44:52.840 --> 00:44:54.060
But Pablo, you're ridiculous!

00:44:54.440 --> 00:44:55.860
I'm a man who doesn't laugh at anything.

00:44:55.880 --> 00:44:57.320
I haven't tried to laugh at you.

00:44:57.420 --> 00:44:57.760
Don't even try!

00:44:58.220 --> 00:44:59.420
Because then we'll see each other's faces.

00:44:59.560 --> 00:44:59.840
Let's go.

00:45:00.060 --> 00:45:00.700
Come on, boy, let's go.

00:45:00.920 --> 00:45:02.880
You're an unconscious.

00:45:03.500 --> 00:45:04.140
Come on, you.

00:45:04.840 --> 00:45:05.420
There it is.

00:45:05.460 --> 00:45:06.680
You went out with yours.

00:45:07.300 --> 00:45:08.440
You've thrown the press on it.

00:45:08.660 --> 00:45:09.520
Walk, please.

00:45:10.020 --> 00:45:12.350
I would have given it a bifeo.

00:45:12.390 --> 00:45:12.750
Served!

00:45:14.550 --> 00:45:16.290
It's the second time you do this to me.

00:45:16.650 --> 00:45:17.750
Look, thank God it's a woman.

00:45:17.990 --> 00:45:19.360
I wish I had been hit by a man.

00:45:19.600 --> 00:45:19.960
Served!

00:45:22.290 --> 00:45:26.470
You're very angry.

00:45:26.990 --> 00:45:28.510
I'm tired of you playing with me.

00:45:30.000 --> 00:45:34.050
...the theater, the journalists, the friends, you have to be more understanding.

00:45:34.650 --> 00:45:37.410
I would understand everything if I was sure of your affection.

00:45:42.740 --> 00:45:43.840
Don't you have it?

00:45:48.540 --> 00:45:55.260
Excuse me, Mrs. Acosta. It doesn't matter.

00:45:55.920 --> 00:45:58.600
Let's see if tomorrow we get a good view.

00:46:00.540 --> 00:46:04.310
Rosita, do you want to come and have a drink with me?

00:46:04.530 --> 00:46:06.230
I can't, Mr. Pedro, it's too late.

00:46:06.570 --> 00:46:07.950
Too late? Perfectly.

00:46:08.150 --> 00:46:09.770
Tomorrow you'll earn less than 20 pesos.

00:46:10.420 --> 00:46:16.900
Forgive me. I did that because I love you.

00:46:17.120 --> 00:46:18.360
Do you know the mess you've created?

00:46:18.700 --> 00:46:19.520
Forgive me.

00:46:19.640 --> 00:46:20.430
Leave me alone.

00:46:20.650 --> 00:46:24.210
I want her to go. I'll keep her company until tomorrow.

00:46:24.610 --> 00:46:25.420
Until tomorrow.

00:46:26.540 --> 00:46:28.560
Tell your boss that this woman is pregnant.

00:46:28.900 --> 00:46:29.840
Of course, sir. I'll tell him.

00:46:30.000 --> 00:46:33.020
And tell him, too, that the one who plays a trick on Mark Howe,

00:46:33.240 --> 00:46:33.940
don't do it again.

00:46:34.340 --> 00:46:34.860
What do you mean?

00:46:34.960 --> 00:46:35.380
Go away.

00:46:35.980 --> 00:46:36.620
What do you mean?

00:46:36.700 --> 00:46:37.380
Go away and tell him.

00:46:37.400 --> 00:46:39.040
But how do you want me to go if you don't let me go?

00:46:43.530 --> 00:46:45.220
You'll give it to him in a few days.

00:46:45.660 --> 00:46:46.740
What are you doing, Joe?

00:46:47.060 --> 00:46:47.300
What?

00:46:47.920 --> 00:46:49.960
Are you going to tell him?

00:46:50.200 --> 00:46:50.400
Speak.

00:47:30.000 --> 00:47:35.510
No, it'll be better later.

00:47:35.590 --> 00:47:38.610
And, um...

00:47:38.920 --> 00:47:40.340
Tonight, after work,

00:47:40.740 --> 00:47:42.690
to receive a telegram from her mother.

00:47:42.930 --> 00:47:45.130
The point is to make the comedy work.

00:47:45.170 --> 00:47:49.650
Do you hear me, little girl? Do you hear me?

00:47:50.180 --> 00:47:51.960
Later. I can't talk now.

00:47:52.140 --> 00:47:55.270
Call me. I want to talk. Call me.

00:47:55.310 --> 00:47:57.880
Hello? Hello.

00:48:02.910 --> 00:48:07.940
What? The bad wolf caught the wave, but you already have the link archived?

00:48:08.280 --> 00:48:10.720
Tell me, who was talking to you?

00:48:10.860 --> 00:48:12.000
I told you about the motorcycle.

00:48:12.260 --> 00:48:12.540
Liar!

00:48:12.680 --> 00:48:15.180
Oh, well, enough! I can't take it anymore!

00:48:15.990 --> 00:48:17.450
You're going to drive me crazy with your jealousy!

00:48:17.650 --> 00:48:19.840
You don't let me go out, you don't look at anyone, you don't even breathe!

00:48:20.420 --> 00:48:23.720
You talk about your love and you don't know what to torment me, to watch over me!

00:48:23.860 --> 00:48:25.180
And I wasn't born for that!

00:48:33.800 --> 00:48:36.940
Forgive me, I love you in another way.

00:48:37.080 --> 00:48:50.610
Have you delivered anything for me, Carmen?

00:48:51.200 --> 00:48:51.920
Nothing, ma'am.

00:48:52.000 --> 00:48:56.170
Are you ready, dear?

00:48:56.470 --> 00:48:57.500
Yes, let's go.

00:48:57.950 --> 00:48:59.130
You've seen how full it is, boys.

00:49:00.000 --> 00:49:01.000
You like it more every time, don't you?

00:49:01.180 --> 00:49:01.860
Oh, I forgot.

00:49:02.440 --> 00:49:03.780
They brought this for you a while ago.

00:49:04.190 --> 00:49:04.470
Telegram?

00:49:04.920 --> 00:49:06.560
Yes, from some admirer, surely.

00:49:07.120 --> 00:49:08.320
Well, see you tomorrow, huh?

00:49:08.500 --> 00:49:15.640
Who is it? What are you going to do?

00:49:16.230 --> 00:49:17.330
I'll have to go to Olivos.

00:49:18.070 --> 00:49:19.470
I'll take you in the car, but don't come in.

00:49:19.860 --> 00:49:21.040
You know that your mother and I...

00:49:21.040 --> 00:49:23.510
It's not worth it. Taxi.

00:49:23.570 --> 00:49:25.540
As you wish, but it won't be anything.

00:49:25.760 --> 00:49:26.580
Come on.

00:49:28.540 --> 00:49:29.660
It would be better if I accompanied you.

00:49:30.000 --> 00:49:30.860
No, thank you.

00:49:30.960 --> 00:49:32.150
If nothing, I'll come back.

00:49:32.760 --> 00:49:34.080
You're going to be cold, maestro.

00:49:34.220 --> 00:49:36.640
Thank you.

00:49:36.800 --> 00:49:37.560
See you later.

00:51:21.180 --> 00:51:22.920
Turn inside, turn, I'll tell you...

00:52:00.000 --> 00:52:00.240
What are you doing, mom?

00:52:30.560 --> 00:52:32.630
I'll explain it to you, you've done a great job.

00:52:34.860 --> 00:52:38.380
Your mother will get upset.

00:52:39.500 --> 00:52:40.300
Now you have to sleep.

00:52:41.190 --> 00:52:42.580
You have to sleep.

00:53:16.860 --> 00:53:18.860
Of course he doesn't know!

00:53:24.828 --> 00:53:27.068
He said he loved him very much.

00:53:27.164 --> 00:53:28.464
She was arrested today.

00:53:28.564 --> 00:53:29.964
Yes, but they let her go because they tried...

00:53:30.000 --> 00:53:31.080
and last night he slept at his house.

00:53:31.180 --> 00:53:31.360
Really?

00:53:31.760 --> 00:53:32.120
Of course!

00:53:32.560 --> 00:53:34.740
I thought he was at the stage last night.

00:53:34.860 --> 00:53:36.220
And they say there have been two

00:53:36.740 --> 00:53:39.820
What a pity they didn't give them to the petiso.

00:53:39.940 --> 00:53:41.930
How is it not going to know who has gone?

00:53:42.150 --> 00:53:44.090
Of course, man! It's a millionaire.

00:53:45.760 --> 00:53:46.660
Did anyone see you coming in or out?

00:53:46.940 --> 00:53:47.260
No.

00:53:47.400 --> 00:53:48.660
And Pablo suspects something?

00:53:48.860 --> 00:53:49.080
No.

00:53:49.220 --> 00:53:50.220
Then don't worry about anything.

00:53:50.360 --> 00:53:52.070
The point is that you don't speak a single word.

00:53:52.130 --> 00:53:52.710
I'm scared.

00:53:53.070 --> 00:53:54.530
Calm down, very calm down.

00:53:54.530 --> 00:53:56.080
Especially if the police interrogates you.

00:54:02.330 --> 00:54:03.750
The sixth, don't you say, if you suspect someone?

00:54:04.070 --> 00:54:05.990
No, everything follows the greatest mystery.

00:54:07.340 --> 00:54:09.260
And you, haven't you had the impression yet?

00:54:10.120 --> 00:54:12.320
Imagine, it's such a terrible thing.

00:54:12.380 --> 00:54:14.740
Well, let's not talk about it anymore and make the magazine.

00:54:15.000 --> 00:54:16.060
Well, I'll be quiet for a while.

00:54:30.000 --> 00:54:39.200
I'll ask you if we'll have a drink.

00:54:39.260 --> 00:54:45.730
And the gentlemen?

00:54:46.010 --> 00:54:47.680
They'll have the kindness to accompany us.

00:54:48.150 --> 00:54:48.630
Who are you?

00:54:48.930 --> 00:54:49.730
We're from the investigation.

00:54:51.170 --> 00:54:51.950
And what do you want from me?

00:54:52.070 --> 00:54:54.870
You accuse me as the author of Eduardo Acosta's murder.

00:54:54.870 --> 00:54:55.280
To me?

00:55:12.380 --> 00:55:15.060
So you don't know anything about this matter?

00:55:15.450 --> 00:55:16.590
I've read it in the newspapers, sir.

00:55:16.980 --> 00:55:20.860
However, you didn't ignore the relations that brought the victim together with...

00:55:20.860 --> 00:55:23.150
excuse me, with his wife.

00:55:23.430 --> 00:55:23.910
As you say?

00:55:24.130 --> 00:55:24.710
Yes, sir.

00:55:25.480 --> 00:55:27.560
Friendship or I don't know, but relations.

00:55:28.690 --> 00:55:29.850
What does this say, ma'am?

00:55:30.380 --> 00:55:33.240
I didn't know him, he was just a simple admirer.

00:55:33.420 --> 00:55:35.760
I'll answer for my wife's honesty.

00:55:37.410 --> 00:55:38.330
We'll also answer.

00:55:38.940 --> 00:55:39.660
Of course we will.

00:55:39.740 --> 00:55:41.200
What are you going to answer for?

00:55:41.340 --> 00:55:44.320
What I don't answer is your nose when we go out on the street.

00:55:44.800 --> 00:55:45.660
Hey, that's a threat, Chief.

00:55:46.080 --> 00:55:47.070
Take note.

00:55:47.490 --> 00:55:47.730
Silence.

00:55:48.130 --> 00:55:51.960
Do you admit that you threatened Mr. Acosta at a party the other night?

00:55:51.980 --> 00:55:52.880
He didn't threaten him.

00:55:53.100 --> 00:55:54.410
They had a small incident.

00:55:55.010 --> 00:55:56.070
Answer, Mr. Rivera.

00:55:56.600 --> 00:55:59.500
I don't know if I threatened him, but from there, murdering him...

00:56:00.320 --> 00:56:02.020
How can you believe that Pablo is capable of this?

00:56:02.340 --> 00:56:04.540
My face doesn't tell you that I'm innocent, Mr. Chief.

00:56:04.820 --> 00:56:06.700
What a fierce face.

00:56:07.320 --> 00:56:09.630
The face should be in his eye.

00:56:09.950 --> 00:56:11.540
I heard that, Mr. Chief.

00:56:11.760 --> 00:56:12.800
Do your job.

00:56:13.100 --> 00:56:14.810
I told you to shut up and take a seat.

00:56:15.010 --> 00:56:21.560
So you didn't kill Mrs. Costa.

00:56:22.830 --> 00:56:24.170
No, sir. I swear.

00:56:24.530 --> 00:56:29.140
Do you also deny knowing this handkerchief that was found last night in the crime scene?

00:56:51.110 --> 00:56:54.640
Confess that you were in the house last night.

00:56:56.840 --> 00:56:58.240
Confess that you are the author of the crime.

00:56:58.730 --> 00:56:59.670
Confess that you are the author of the crime.

00:57:00.440 --> 00:57:04.380
Enough for the moment.

00:57:05.540 --> 00:57:07.180
Put the detainee in the office with you.

00:57:07.300 --> 00:57:09.520
The rest can retire.

00:57:09.860 --> 00:57:14.620
I need you for some additional data.

00:57:14.880 --> 00:57:15.820
As you command, sir.

00:57:16.080 --> 00:57:19.030
Then I'm going to need it on the street.

00:57:19.130 --> 00:57:20.380
To break his soul.

00:57:20.870 --> 00:57:21.270
Heard?

00:57:21.470 --> 00:57:23.050
I want you to cut that human brain.

00:57:34.800 --> 00:57:36.660
For God's sake, everything I've told you is the only truth.

00:57:38.270 --> 00:57:41.000
Now, Pablo, do what you want.

00:57:41.040 --> 00:57:43.800
But why did you go to that house? Why?

00:57:45.060 --> 00:57:49.120
I don't know. I was so bitter, I decided with our arguments.

00:57:50.400 --> 00:57:53.460
That man crossed my path, perhaps out of spite.

00:57:54.380 --> 00:57:55.540
Because you've never loved me.

00:57:56.340 --> 00:57:59.000
Yes, Pablo, I love you. Now I know.

00:58:00.000 --> 00:58:02.480
I've seen what you're capable of for me, and I don't want you to pay for my guilt.

00:58:03.010 --> 00:58:04.770
Right now, I'm going to tell you the whole truth.

00:58:06.160 --> 00:58:08.100
It's not about you or him.

00:58:08.200 --> 00:58:11.310
And what we need to know is who killed Eduardo.

00:58:12.560 --> 00:58:13.380
I have a palpitation.

00:58:14.090 --> 00:58:14.450
Which one?

00:58:15.580 --> 00:58:16.060
Petito killed him.

00:58:16.100 --> 00:58:19.400
Good evening.

00:58:19.660 --> 00:58:19.980
Good evening.

00:58:20.430 --> 00:58:23.350
And you know, Mr. Chief, I'm at your disposal for everything you want.

00:58:23.490 --> 00:58:29.890
As if to trust your little faces.

00:58:30.000 --> 00:58:35.490
I have an idea. Come with me.

00:58:35.650 --> 00:58:35.910
Where?

00:58:36.280 --> 00:58:38.450
Just a hug. We'll see each other again.

00:58:38.530 --> 00:58:41.260
And don't worry. I'll clear this up.

00:58:41.260 --> 00:58:43.140
Or I'll sing more tangos in my life.

00:58:43.240 --> 00:58:43.580
Come on.

00:58:43.760 --> 00:58:56.460
The decent people always rush out of this house.

00:58:57.100 --> 00:58:58.300
The criminals stay.

00:59:00.000 --> 00:59:00.600
We'll go out too.

00:59:01.370 --> 00:59:01.830
Let's go?

00:59:02.010 --> 00:59:02.430
Let's go.

00:59:02.490 --> 00:59:12.900
Who would have said that boy...

00:59:12.900 --> 00:59:14.400
I never liked the guy.

00:59:15.000 --> 00:59:16.620
And to think that I'm so close to him.

00:59:16.820 --> 00:59:20.100
You should look for your friendships between decent people like me.

00:59:36.460 --> 00:59:39.610
I feel like having some air, but it's early in the morning.

00:59:39.850 --> 00:59:41.470
Don't you want to go to Palermo?

00:59:41.510 --> 00:59:43.590
Of course not. I'd love to.

00:59:44.050 --> 00:59:45.490
But before that, I have to go to Acoplado.

00:59:45.570 --> 00:59:46.250
Yes, to Acoplado.

00:59:46.250 --> 00:59:49.010
Shut up. We'll drop you off at your place.

00:59:49.380 --> 00:59:50.480
As long as you don't go too far.

01:00:01.440 --> 01:00:04.050
It's all for Palermo. What are you doing, man?

01:00:04.390 --> 01:00:05.470
The people first, man.

01:00:17.800 --> 01:00:22.400
Look, where do you live?

01:00:22.760 --> 01:00:23.800
It's still missing.

01:00:24.430 --> 01:00:25.150
What do you mean it's missing?

01:00:25.550 --> 01:00:26.730
We've spent ten days in Saavedra.

01:00:32.170 --> 01:00:34.450
And from here we go to San Isidro, which is where he lives.

01:00:34.910 --> 01:00:35.910
How San Isidro?

01:00:36.930 --> 01:00:39.810
But why did you bring me here?

01:00:40.220 --> 01:00:40.900
For that reason.

01:00:41.200 --> 01:00:42.300
Don't scream, I'll stab you.

01:00:42.660 --> 01:00:44.320
But this is an ambush.

01:00:44.840 --> 01:00:45.900
What do you want from me?

01:00:45.980 --> 01:00:47.880
That you tell us everything you know about the death of Acosta.

01:00:47.980 --> 01:00:48.820
I'll kill him first.

01:00:49.080 --> 01:00:50.660
Liar, he didn't separate you from me.

01:00:50.780 --> 01:00:52.140
You must know what enemies he had.

01:00:52.320 --> 01:00:54.040
I don't know anything, let me go.

01:00:54.460 --> 01:00:54.820
Quiet!

01:00:55.560 --> 01:00:57.120
I'll send you to hell.

01:00:57.600 --> 01:00:57.960
Speak.

01:01:02.420 --> 01:01:03.720
What do you want me to say?

01:01:03.880 --> 01:01:05.860
Someone hated him, someone threatened him once.

01:01:06.260 --> 01:01:06.660
Nobody?

01:01:06.900 --> 01:01:08.280
That's right.

01:01:08.500 --> 01:01:08.880
Speak.

01:01:09.310 --> 01:01:10.430
The lover of Margot.

01:01:10.530 --> 01:01:14.020
The other night at the party, he threatened to take revenge on her.

01:01:14.300 --> 01:01:15.490
Enough, that's the guy.

01:01:15.720 --> 01:01:17.320
Driver, go back to the center.

01:01:17.460 --> 01:01:17.800
What are you going to do?

01:01:18.000 --> 01:01:18.740
Stop that guy right now.

01:01:19.460 --> 01:01:20.520
Then I'm going down.

01:01:20.520 --> 01:01:20.740
Quiet!

01:01:21.240 --> 01:01:23.100
You who set up Lila, you're going to follow us.

01:01:30.920 --> 01:01:32.900
Good morning. Where do you live, Mrs. Margot?

01:01:33.140 --> 01:01:33.460
Mertica.

01:01:33.600 --> 01:01:33.820
Yes.

01:01:34.000 --> 01:01:35.020
Yes, Mertica, number 4.

01:01:35.200 --> 01:01:35.620
Thank you very much.

01:01:35.960 --> 01:01:44.620
You're going to leave without paying for what you've done.

01:01:45.280 --> 01:01:47.670
Shut up. You know me.

01:01:47.750 --> 01:01:49.250
I don't want to shut up. I'm not afraid of anything.

01:02:00.800 --> 01:02:04.180
Quiet, watch out, the Marcao is a very dangerous guy.

01:02:04.860 --> 01:02:06.140
They told me his name is very Alto.

01:02:06.420 --> 01:02:12.860
Alto? Look if it will be Alto, that to look at him from foot to head you have to rest on the navel.

01:02:13.000 --> 01:02:18.360
Yes, yes.

01:02:18.760 --> 01:02:19.700
I'm going to take off more.

01:02:19.940 --> 01:02:22.020
I'm going back.

01:02:22.660 --> 01:02:24.280
Well, go with the vigilante of the cell quickly.

01:02:24.620 --> 01:02:25.560
I'm going with him.

01:02:25.700 --> 01:02:28.270
Oh, go, lazy. But bring the police soon.

01:02:28.310 --> 01:02:28.850
Yes, yes, yes, yes.

01:02:33.360 --> 01:02:37.030
Alba, now. The police are downstairs.

01:02:37.290 --> 01:02:42.740
What? And who are you?

01:02:42.780 --> 01:02:45.540
A friend of Margot's. The police know everything. I'm here to tell you.

01:02:45.700 --> 01:02:46.760
Where is Margot?

01:02:46.860 --> 01:02:49.730
There she is. She must have sold herself.

01:02:53.010 --> 01:02:53.410
Margot!

01:03:00.510 --> 01:03:01.070
No, it wasn't her.

01:03:01.290 --> 01:03:02.160
Who was it?

01:03:02.220 --> 01:03:03.230
Me. What's the matter?

01:03:03.870 --> 01:03:09.610
You. You. And that?

01:03:09.850 --> 01:03:11.850
Open up.

01:03:11.850 --> 01:03:19.820
Open up, I say.

01:03:28.490 --> 01:03:28.890
Don't move.

01:03:31.280 --> 01:03:33.340
